Replacing an existing ceiling light like-for-like is not notifiable.

- **Regulation 12(6A)** makes electrical work notifiable only if it is one of three things:
  - installing a new circuit;
  - replacing a consumer unit;
  - adding to or altering an existing circuit in a "special location" (the zone round a bath or shower, or a room with a pool or sauna heater).
